xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/6b06dce5-8466-4194-bfec-d9845cb1a1dc.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/091c5c71-75dc-4be4-9241-b4e1324fee48.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/b90cced9-918a-4bf3-a324-aa121ef33557.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/541974/74675541974.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/541974/71852541974.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/541974/66230541974.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/541974/5419740319.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Manorama Industries Limited reported a strong start to FY27 with a revenue growth of 39.5% YoY in Q1 FY27 and a 67.6% surge in quarterly profitability, crossing INR 4,000 million in quarterly revenue for the first time. The company expanded its West African sourcing presence by incorporating a wholly owned subsidiary in Chad and acquiring land for a Shea seed processing facility in Burkina Faso. Additionally, the company completed a INR 500 Crores QIP raise in July 2026 to strengthen its balance sheet ahead of future capex cycles. Manorama Industries reported strong performance for FY 2026, driven by a 76.1% year-on-year growth in standalone revenues to INR 1,358 crores, strong EBITDA margins, and improved working capital efficiency. The company outlined a strategic capex plan of approximately INR 460 crores over the next two to three years for backward and forward integration, including facilities in Burkina Faso and India.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted sustained demand across key end-user industries supported by the growing contribution of the value-added specialty fats and butters portfolio.","quote":"Profitability increased by 67.6% YoY, reflecting sustained demand across key end-user industries, deeper customer engagement, and the growing contribution of our value-added specialty fats and butters portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d95385ba-0352-409d-b3b9-79aeb633a210.pdf"},{"claim":"Demand remains sustained and growing across food and cosmetic sectors worldwide.","quote":"the sustained and growing demand we continue to witness across the food and cosmetic sectors worldwide through our scientific and high-tech products, which are being used all over the world.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=44ed65ad-71ad-4172-89aa-1683f5423a5d.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company plans a strategic capex of approximately INR 460 crores over the next two to three years.","quote":"Through strategic capital expenditure commitment of approximately INR 460 crores over the next two to three years, this investment program spans setting up of a new solvent fractionation manufacturing facility for Sal, Shea, Palm, Mango and other exotic seeds and ESOS.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=44ed65ad-71ad-4172-89aa-1683f5423a5d.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Standalone EBITDA margin for FY 25-26 stood at 27.1%.","quote":"EBITDA INR 367.7 crores with an EBITDA margin of 27.1%, reflecting focused product mix optimization and disciplined cost management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=44ed65ad-71ad-4172-89aa-1683f5423a5d.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Finished goods packing capability is at 30,000 MTPA.","quote":"30,000 MTPA finished goods packing capability","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d95385ba-0352-409d-b3b9-79aeb633a210.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Net cash flow from operating activities stood at INR 259 crores.","quote":"Net cash flow from operating activities stood at INR 259 crores, ROCE of 33.6% and ROE of 40.3%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=44ed65ad-71ad-4172-89aa-1683f5423a5d.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"A strategic capital expenditure commitment of approximately INR 460 crores is planned over the next two to three years.","quote":"Through strategic capital expenditure commitment of approximately INR 460 crores over the next two to three years, this investment program spans setting up of a new solvent fractionation manufacturing facility for Sal, Shea, Palm, Mango and other exotic seeds and ESOS.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=44ed65ad-71ad-4172-89aa-1683f5423a5d.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":2,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":7,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":21,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped. Skipped — concall_transcript: RemoteProtocolError: Server disconnected without sending a response."}}